hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"449","Ibn Nufayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, mere khandan ki ek khatun ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mulaykah bint Amr se, ke un ke halaq ke dard ke liye unhen gaaye ka ghee tajweez kiya gaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ka doodh shifa hai, us ka ghee dawa hai aur us ka gosht beemari hai."
"450","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne humen khabar di, Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Budh aur Hafta ke din pachhne lagwaye phir use wazah ho jaye to wo apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye sanad ke sath riwayat hua hai lekin ye sahih nahin hai."
"451","Abu Mamar aur Ahmad ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hafs ibn Ghiyas ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Artah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs pachhne lagwana chahe to Hafta ke din pachhne lagwaye. Ahmad al-Duri ne kaha: Aur Hafs ne kaha: Maine ye Sufyan al-Thawri ko bayan kiya to unhon ne usi jagah hajjam ko bulaya aur pachhne lagwaye."
"452","Ali ibn al-Jad ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Raja se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hasan se nushrah ke bare me pucha to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se naql karke bataya gaya ke Aap ne farmaya: Ye shaitan ke amal me se hai."
